Bundled third-party data
------------------------
src/llm_bench/datasets/ contains the HumanEval+ v0.1.10 problem set published by the
EvalPlus project (https://github.com/evalplus/evalplus, Apache-2.0), which
extends the HumanEval problems by OpenAI (https://github.com/openai/human-eval,
MIT). Its licence text is kept beside the data. tests/fixtures/ruler-upstream/
contains small excerpts of NVIDIA RULER (https://github.com/NVIDIA/RULER,
Apache-2.0) with its licence.

External tools
--------------
real-bench does not redistribute the tools it drives. At run time it downloads
and invokes AIPerf, Hugging Face Transformers, the pinned EvalPlus grading
container, and the pinned NVIDIA RULER sources (see third_party/lock.yaml), each
under its own licence.
